01pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><big><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;SegoeUI-Semilight&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:#373737\">― Mahalliy byudjetdan olinadigan ssuda va boshqa imtiyozli kredit shartnomalarini rasmiylashtirish va hisobini yurita olishi kerak.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><big><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;SegoeUI-Semilight&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:#373737\">― Rus va ingliz tillarida erkin muloqot qila olishi kerak.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><big><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;SegoeUI-Semilight&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:#373737\">Nomzodlar oʻz ma&rsquo;lumotnomalarini rus yoki oʻzbek tillarida (CV Word shaklida) </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;SegoeUI-Semilight&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:#4f81bd\">info@het.uz </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;SegoeUI-Semilight&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:#373737\">elektron pochta manziliga yuborishlari mumkin.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><big><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;SegoeUI-Semilight&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:#373737\">Bogʻlanish uchun&nbsp;(78) 150-75-60&nbsp;telefon raqami orqali murojaat qilishingiz mumkin. Hujjatlar&nbsp;2024 yil 29 iyul soat 18:00&nbsp;gacha qabul qilinadi.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 'f7b4048a-495b-6c13-3b84-e4d6ad6abcb5_lists_.jpg', 'ec558c8a-b839-fba5-cc14-98eda101c073_lists_.jpg', 924, 1, 4, NULL, 1721372039, 1760678126, ''),
