(2534, 2067, 'ru', '№6 от 21.08.2024', '', '', NULL, NULL, 434, 1, 4, NULL, 1724321231, 1760884853, 'e67190b7-ecc6-5502-2ea3-6b6970101650_media_.pdf'),
(2535, 2068, 'oz', '#Mahalla_obod_yurt_obod ', ' ', '<p><big><strong>Davlatimiz mustaqilligining 33 yillik bayramini nishonlashga munosib tayyorgarlik ko&lsquo;rish hamda &nbsp;mahallalar, aholi turar joylarini obodonlashtirish va kо&lsquo;kalamzorlashtirish maqsadida &ldquo;Mahalla obod &mdash; yurt obod&rdquo; shiori ostida mamlakatimiz bо&lsquo;ylab hasharlar о&lsquo;tkazilmoqda.&nbsp;</strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/c529aeee-555f-1f06-a54c-eda3265da8f8_media_.jpg\" /></strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/7b0b343c-15c4-43f0-66f0-fc2246103401_media_.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/56dc01d2-37e4-2e31-781d-2964d36e1b4a_media_.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><strong>Bugun &quot;Hududiy elektr tarmoqlari&quot; AJ xodimlari ishtirokida ham ana shu xayrli tashabbusni qо&lsquo;llab-quvvatlash maqsadida hashar tashkil etilib, unda bino atrofini tozalash va chiqindilardan tozalash, daraxtlarni butalash va oqlash, &nbsp;yondosh hududlarni kо&lsquo;kalamzorlashtirish kabi ishlar uyushqoqlik bilan olib borildi.</strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/9f529eea-5be7-7ae0-b8cb-06c6382ea10f_media_.jpg\" /></strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/c9356c8c-56ff-a6fb-0e54-efc3e8bf9637_media_.jpg\" /></strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/e5e5c959-de9c-bcff-2cad-1ef0dd91b24e_media_.jpg\" /></strong></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><strong>Bunday obodonchilik ishlari Jamiyatning hududlardagi barcha korxona va filiallarida о&lsquo;tkazilmoqda.</strong></big></p>\r\n', '4737dcca-b7e1-b83f-1ab9-f7c16a8d4fa2_lists_.jpg', 'de046b40-3623-96a3-6ce7-ac810b81f021_lists_.jpg', 1437, 1, 4, NULL, 1724483248, 1760931940, ''),
(2536, 2072, 'oz', 'SHARAFLI UNVON VA MUKOFOTLARGA SAZOVOR BО‘LGAN XODIMLAR TAQDIRLANDI', 'SHARAFLI UNVON VA MUKOFOTLARGA SAZOVOR BО‘LGAN XODIMLAR TAQDIRLANDI\r\n\r\nBugun, 30 avgust kuni О‘zbekiston Respublikasi mustaqilligining 33 yillik bayrami munosabati bilan “Hududiy elektr tarmoqlari” AJ majlislar zalida \"Bir bо‘lsak – yagona xalqmiz, birlashsak – Vatanmiz\" shiori ostida bayram tadbiri о‘tkazildi.', '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><big>SHARAFLI UNVON VA MUKOFOTLARGA SAZOVOR BО&lsquo;LGAN XODIMLAR TAQDIRLANDI</big></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/d5b48734-593c-2156-e4ce-7d4546220a0f_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/4379dea0-bbdf-f850-a9fe-402213037776_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big>Bugun, 30 avgust kuni О&lsquo;zbekiston Respublikasi mustaqilligining 33 yillik bayrami munosabati bilan &ldquo;Hududiy elektr tarmoqlari&rdquo; AJ majlislar zalida &quot;Bir bо&lsquo;lsak &ndash; yagona xalqmiz, birlashsak &ndash; Vatanmiz&quot; shiori ostida bayram tadbiri о&lsquo;tkazildi.</big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/71f208d2-93fc-e0f0-5e42-465a0898dcc3_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big>Tadbir davomida Boshqaruv raisi Ulug&lsquo;bek Mustafoyev sо&lsquo;z olib, istiqlol nashidasi, bayram sururi barchani yaxshi niyatlar, ezguliklar sari undashi, Vatan tuyg&lsquo;usi bilan yashash, о&lsquo;zi tug&lsquo;ilib о&lsquo;sgan ona yurtini sevish va ardoqlash, mamlakat mustaqilligini mustahkamlash yо&lsquo;lida barcha imkoniyatlarni ishga solib harakat qilish eng oliy tuyg&lsquo;u ekanligi haqida о&lsquo;z fikr-mulohazalarini bildirib о&lsquo;tdi.</big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/49d44b3f-d147-5530-5e38-d06a6f763ca8_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/359eb828-990b-8b72-f4d5-a4a592a63085_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big>Bugun davlatimiz iqtisodiyoti va aholi farovonligini yuksaltirishda energetiklarimiz ham baholi qudrat hissalarini qо&lsquo;shib kelmoqdalar. Sarhisob yilida respublikamiz aholisi va iqtisodiyot tarmoqlarini ishonchli elektr energiyasi bilan ta&rsquo;minlash, tizim rivoji yо&lsquo;lidagi amaliy say-harakatlari uchun Jamiyatimiz xodimlari ham sharafli unvon va mukofotlarga sazovor bо&lsquo;lganlari yuqoridagi fikrlarga dalil bо&lsquo;loladi. Xususan, bir guruh xodimlar Mustaqil davlatlar hamkorligi Elektr energetika kengashining &ldquo;Mustaqil davlatlar hamdо&lsquo;stligida xizmat kо&lsquo;rsatgan energetik&rdquo; unvoni va maqtov yorliqlari, О&lsquo;zbekiston Respublikasi Energetika vazirligining faxriy yorliqlari bilan taqdirlanganlarini e&rsquo;tirof etib о&lsquo;tish joizdir.</big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/70e38a90-dbb5-788c-bf62-f501d56ca2a9_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/785ea61d-7d00-6bd2-1aa4-5cf35aa57988_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big>Shuningdek, bayram tadbirida tizim yuksalishi yо&lsquo;lidagi kо&lsquo;p yillik samarali va sermahsul xizmatlari, jamoat ishlaridagi faol ishtiroki yuqori baholangan bir guruh xodimlarga &ldquo;Hududiy elektr tarmoqlari&rdquo; AJ Boshqaruv raisining Tashakkurnoma yorliqlari topshirildi.</big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/4d6d1166-41a9-a6a7-92e7-5e20385a1438_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n', '58171203-02c9-6ef5-7aef-088c48521340_lists_.jpg', 'd0220b19-0e5d-5f7c-843a-13dd48b7865a_lists_.jpg', 1654, 1, 4, NULL, 1725030045, 1760843775, ''),
(2537, 2073, 'oz', 'Avval xabar berilganidek, bugun Energetiklar sihatgohida “Hududiy elektr tarmoqlari” AJ xodimlari o‘rtasida mini futbol va shaxmat bo‘yicha “Boshqaruv raisi kubogi” musobaqasining respublika bosqichiga start berildi.', 'Avval xabar berilganidek, bugun Energetiklar sihatgohida “Hududiy elektr tarmoqlari” AJ xodimlari o‘rtasida mini futbol va shaxmat bo‘yicha “Boshqaruv raisi kubogi” musobaqasining respublika bosqichiga start berildi.\r\n\r\n', '<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/a36f1db1-59ab-726d-855c-7f18f702cfee_media_.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big>Avval xabar berilganidek, bugun Energetiklar sihatgohida &ldquo;Hududiy elektr tarmoqlari&rdquo; AJ xodimlari o&lsquo;rtasida mini futbol va shaxmat bo&lsquo;yicha &ldquo;Boshqaruv raisi kubogi&rdquo; musobaqasining respublika bosqichiga start berildi.</big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/0f0d42df-869f-16c2-c607-161ac6b50dac_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/9d8d4486-bea0-6081-598a-8d849122efd0_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/140101ba-e5b6-5b1f-cea0-7212c1149792_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big>O&lsquo;zbekiston Respublikasi Mustaqilligining 33 yilligi munosbati bilan &ldquo;Bir bo&lsquo;lsak &ndash; yagona xalqmiz, birlashsak &ndash; Vatanmiz!&rdquo; shiori ostida o&lsquo;tkazilayotgan tadbirda Jamiyat tizim korxona va tashkilotlarining jami 18 ta jamoasi ishtirok etmoqda.</big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/39ce7b5a-8344-2fb1-bbed-09bdf387ac79_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/0b11b377-dce7-02dd-6e8b-b888e3d15315_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big>Bugun erta tongdan musobaqa ishtirokchilari о&lsquo;tkazilgan natijalariga kо&lsquo;ra mini futbol hamda shaxmat musobaqalariga kirishishdi.</big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/1bff94dc-8a08-9795-c605-b975b1c9e297_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/9664fa07-07e0-019f-4241-e4cdc9c59ff9_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p><big><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://het.uz/uploads/e1f1e555-e6bd-df82-2958-f2488ac02d67_media_.jpg\" /></big></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '480bd076-63e3-f9f2-5aee-548ef262f245_lists_.jpg', '78ea0201-2ef5-2757-0fa2-5973289a40c8_lists_.jpg', 1389, 1, 4, NULL, 1725605516, 1760844017, ''),
(2538, 2074, 'oz', '09 от 30.08.2024', '', '', NULL, NULL, 794, 1, 4, NULL, 1725881772, 1760770256, '2effd6ae-0b14-457f-10d1-f6ba83bbb316_media_.pdf'),
